  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your control over the woven vines extending from your body is extreme, and when wrapped around your arm can be quite dangerous.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Draide alraun</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your reach when making melee touch attacks is increased by +5 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may take this feat a total of twice. When taken a second time, your normal reach is increased by +5 ft., and you may make touch attacks at +5 ft beyond that.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><sup><strong>U:</strong> Part of Ultimate Spheres of Power and does not need to be bought separately from that book</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/racial-feats#toc38\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
